      "content": "Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\boxed{}.\n\nHow many packages did Julia and Nadine buy? Julia and Nadine bought 1 dozen balloons sold for $0.60 per 2 balloons. The balloons are sold in equal-sized packages of 2 balloons.",
      "role": "user"
